# Build context SEMUA image = root repo (dockerfile: docker/*.Dockerfile).
# Prinsip: yang gak dibutuhin runtime jangan masuk context -- dan yang
# BERISI SECRET jangan pernah masuk layer image manapun (checklist cutover:
# "gak ada secret di layer image").

# --- Secret & data produksi (JANGAN masuk layer apa pun) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
secrets/
# kredensial prod + dump Mongo (~110MB) + static legacy -- Fase 0, cuma arsip lokal
legacy/
tools/salvage/
tests/fixtures/
tests/fixture_report*.json
# sertifikat TLS self-signed nginx (dibuat container saat runtime): ada KUNCI PRIVATnya
docker/nginx/tls/

# --- VCS / tooling ---
.git
.github
.gitignore
.gitleaks.toml
.vscode
.DS_Store
graphify-out/
.claude/

# --- Python artefak ---
.venv/
.venv-legacy/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
celerybeat-schedule*

# --- Web ---
**/node_modules/
apps/web/.next/
apps/web/out/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Yang gak dipakai runtime ---
tests/
docs/
tools/codemod/
*.log

# variabel level compose (bisa berisi POSTGRES_PASSWORD)
docker/stack.env
